<title>USA: St. Joe Corp names Ledsinger CFO.</title>
<headline>St. Joe Corp names Ledsinger CFO.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>St. Joe Corp said Tuesday it named Charles Ledsinger, chief financial officer and senior vice president</p>
<p>Ledsinger, former CFO and vice president of Harrah's Entertainment, a subsidiary of Promus Hotel Corp, has been with Harrah's since 1978 and CFO since 1990.</p>
<p>The company was unavailable for immediate comment.</p>
